🔹 🔹 Sectionn 3: Agentic RAG
✅ ✅ ✅ ✅ ✅ ✅ ✅ ✅ ✅ ✅ ✅ ✅ ✅ ✅ ✅ 

Agentic RAG extends traditional RAG by allowing the LLM to act as an agent that can plan, route, retrieve, evaluate, and re-retrieve information before answering. Unlike naive RAG, which performs a single retrieval step, Agentic RAG supports query rewriting, multi-hop retrieval, self-correction, tool usage, routing across data sources, and controlled retrieval loops to improve accuracy and reduce hallucinations.

One-Line Memory Trick

Naive RAG = Search Once → Answer

Agentic RAG = Think → Plan → Search → Verify → Search Again → Answer 🚀

