	✅  Agentic RAG - Query Planning and Rewriting

		🔹 This is where Agentic RAG becomes powerful. A smart agent break down the task into smaller steps 
		🔹 If requires rewrite the user question to avoid ambiguity
		🔹 decomposing multi-part questions, multi-hop retrieval across documents


	✅  Agentic RAG  - Self correcting retrieval (grade the retrieved chunks, re-query when relevance is low (Corrective RAG, Self-RAG))

		Search
